(\mathcal{C})$, the care-correction sheaf's own cohomology, and produces a new obstruction in $H^{n+1}(\mathcal{E})$, the empathy-error sheaf's cohomology one degree higher, giving a precise formal sense in which addressing one lack can surface, rather than eliminate, a further one.
+
